B.a9X=new A.cn("n01","A Tafel slope of 42 mV/dec | indicated a rate-determining | first electron transfer.")
B.a9U=new A.cn("n02","The (111) reflection at 2\u03b8 = 43.6\xb0 | broadened as | the crystallite size fell.")
B.a9Q=new A.cn("n03","Scherrer analysis gave | a crystallite size of 8.4 \xb1 0.6 nm | for the calcined powder.")
B.aae=new A.cn("n04","Extended X-ray absorption fine structure | resolved a Ni\u2013O coordination number | of 4.2.")
B.aaj=new A.cn("n05","A gas hourly space velocity of 24,000 mL/g/h | was held | for the entire run.")
B.aaf=new A.cn("n06","Sulfur was kept below 50 ppm | to avoid | irreversible poisoning.")
B.aa6=new A.cn("n07","Ostwald ripening coarsened the particles, | whereas encapsulation | suppressed coalescence.")
B.aa_=new A.cn("n08","The kinetics followed | a Mars\u2013van Krevelen mechanism | rather than Langmuir\u2013Hinshelwood.")
B.aa5=new A.cn("n09","The area-specific resistance rose | to 0.31 \u03a9 cm\xb2 | after five hundred hours.")
B.a9M=new A.cn("n10","Diffraction used Cu K\u03b1 radiation | with \u03bb = 1.5406 \xc5 | at room temperature.")
B.aa3=new A.cn("n11","The adsorption enthalpy \u0394H | was \u221278 kJ/mol | on the stepped facet.")
B.a9R=new A.cn("n12","Electrical conductivity reached | 3.6 \xd7 10\u207b\xb2 S/cm | after carbonisation.")
B.a9P=new A.cn("n13","Operando DRIFTS detected | a bridging carbonate band | at 1580 cm\u207b\xb9.")
B.aad=new A.cn("n14","Isotopic labelling with \xb9\xb3CH4 | confirmed that lattice carbon | entered the product.")
B.a9W=new A.cn("n15","The reverse water-gas shift (RWGS) | consumed hydrogen | above 700 \xb0C.")
B.a9O=new A.cn("n16","NH3-TPD quantified | 0.42 mmol/g of | moderately strong acid sites.")
B.aag=new A.cn("n17","BJH analysis showed | a bimodal pore distribution | centred near 4 and 19 nm.")
B.aai=new A.cn("n18","Electrochemical impedance spectroscopy | produced a depressed Nyquist semicircle | on the aged electrode.")
B.aa7=new A.cn("n19","Rietveld refinement converged | with \u03c7\xb2 of 1.7 | and a weighted R-factor of 4.9%.")
B.aa1=new A.cn("n20","Single-atom alloys (SAA) | dissociated methane | without extensive coke formation.")
B.aah=new A.cn("n21","Multiwalled carbon nanotubes grew | from coordinatively unsaturated | nickel step edges.")
B.aa8=new A.cn("n22","The double-layer capacitance was | 28 \u03bcF/cm\xb2 | in one molar potassium hydroxide.")
B.aab=new A.cn("n23","Selectivity toward ethylene | exceeded 71%, | whereas methane stayed below 3%.")
B.a9L=new A.cn("n24","Micrographs recorded at 200,000\xd7 | resolved lattice fringes | across the shell.")
B.aal=new A.cn("n25","Pyrolysis proceeded at 5 \xb0C/min | under flowing argon | to 900 \xb0C.")
B.aam=new A.cn("n26","The isotherm showed type IV hysteresis, | consistent with | high pore tortuosity.")
